PROJECT OVERVIEW
 * Concept: Next-generation sci-fi survival/crafting/empire-building video game concept.
 * Visual Engine Standard: Unreal Engine 5.8 hyper-realistic game graphics rendering.
 * Core Themes: Post-apocalyptic survival, scavenger progression, sci-fi tech advancement, genetic splicing, base automation, combined-arms warfare, and player/AI empire governance.
GAMEPLAY MECHANICS & FEATURE SPECIFICATIONS
1. Scavenging & World Exploration
 * Environment Types: Ruined urban cities, industrial wastelands, alien-contaminated zones, coastal regions, and deep abyssal ocean trenches.
 * Resource Extraction: Harvesting scrap, scavenged technology, ancient/alien artifacts, and rare resources from hostile environments.
2. Base Building & KYRAX AI Assistance
 * Manual & Automated Construction: Freeform base construction supplemented by an integrated AI companion named KYRAX.
 * KYRAX Capabilities:
   * Interactive holographic blueprint projections.
   * Real-time structural integrity checks.
   * Automated defense system placement (turrets, automated gates, security barriers).
   * Squad-wide construction synchronization for multi-player builds.
 * Defensive Gameplay: Base defense mechanics against incoming attacks from players or rival AI factions.
3. Tech Tree & Progression
 * Early Tier: Primal survival gear (e.g., improvised weapons made from sharpened bones).
 * Late Tier: High-tech military technology, including:
   * Plasma weaponry.
   * Cloaking fields / optical camouflage.
   * Heavy combat mechs.
   * Orbital strikes requested via personal companion AI.
4. Genetic Splicing (DNA Harvest System)
 * Biological Modification: Players harvest alien DNA from defeated hostiles/creatures to graft alien traits directly onto their character.
 * Acquired Mutations/Abilities:
   * Enhanced vision (e.g., night vision).
   * Combat buffs (e.g., berserker rage).
   * Environmental resistances (e.g., radiation immunity).
   * Exotic biological perks derived from alien tissue.
5. Factions, Diplomacy & Empire Building
 * Governance: Ability to recruit players, construct an empire, and manage territories.
 * Diplomacy Systems: Form alliances, break treaties, and engage in large-scale territorial warfare.
 * Advanced AI Factions: Dynamic AI empires that utilize the exact same mechanics, progression systems, and base-building tools as human players.
6. Combined-Arms Vehicles & Domains
 * Subsurface / Aquatic: Deep-sea submersibles tailored for abyssal trench exploration and diving into submerged alien ruins.
 * Airspace Control: Fighter/VTOL aircraft for contested air combat and reconnaissance.
 * Ground Warfare: Heavy armored tanks and land vehicles for coastal and overland combat operations.
